<title>USA: May NYMEX crude delivery record 6.621 mln bbls.</title>
<headline>May NYMEX crude delivery record 6.621 mln bbls.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-04-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>Total crude deliveries against the May NYMEX contract set a record of 6.621 million barrels since crude futures began trading on the exchange in 1983, a NYMEX source said Thursday.</p>
<p>The last record was for 5.105 million barrels on the July 1992 contract.</p>
<p>The foreign portion of the total deliveries was 2.73 million barrels, the source said.</p>
</text>
